        │ jj diff -r @ printed nothing: the revision changes no file.  │        
        │ The working copy is often empty right after jj new; jj-diff  │        
        │ -r @- reads its parent.                                      │        
        │                                                              │        
        │ ctrl+l reload  q quit                                        │        
